Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:19.09,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,konna koto ii na   dekitara ii na
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:19.09,OPtl,,0,0,0,,I wish I had this...   I wish I could do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.26,0:00:24.60,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,anna yume konna yume  ippai aru kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.26,0:00:24.60,OPtl,,0,0,0,,This kind of dream, that kind of dream... There are lots of kinds, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.93,0:00:28.60,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,minna minna minna   kanaete kureru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.93,0:00:28.60,OPtl,,0,0,0,,Each and every one of them can come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.77,0:00:33.46,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,fushigi na pokke de kanaete kureru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.77,0:00:33.46,OPtl,,0,0,0,,With his mysterious pocket, he'll make all your dreams come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.27,0:00:38.03,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,sora wo jiyuu ni tobitai na
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.27,0:00:38.03,OPtl,,0,0,0,,I'd sure like to fly about freely in the sky...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:41.11,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,"hai! take koputaa"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:41.11,OPtl,,0,0,0,,"All right! Bamboo 'Copter!"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:49.04,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,an an an  tottemo daisuki Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:49.04,OPtl,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh... I love you so much, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.41,0:00:56.80,OPromaji,,0,0,0,,an an an  tottemo daisuki Doraemon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.41,0:00:56.80,OPtl,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh... I love you so much, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.08,0:01:17.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(646,497)}Slow-Slow, Quick-Quick
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.35,0:01:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}"Slow-Slow, Quick-Quick!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.01,0:01:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Man, that Nobita-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}He's {\i1}always {\i0} \Nleaving the place so messy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.15,0:01:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, Doraemon...!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.77,0:01:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.63,0:01:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}My friend, \NDoraemon-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.02,0:01:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The great \NDoraemon-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.91,0:01:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.34,0:01:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.27,0:01:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Here's some dorayaki \Nthat you like so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.29,0:01:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}If this is about me doing your\N homework, the answer's no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Aw...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.02,0:01:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You know me too well...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.31,0:01:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\q0}Well, we do keep going through \Nthe same thing day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.73,0:01:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But if I don't get your help, \NI'll never finish it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.67,0:01:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And {\i1}WHY {\i0} do you \Nthink it's like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.18,0:02:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2\be1}In cases like this, don't you think you need \Nto really think and reflect over the situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.45,0:02:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.46,0:02:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hmm... \NI wonder why...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.18,0:02:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Why do you think?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.60,0:02:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.47,0:02:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah... \NI wonder why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.15,0:02:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I can't figure it out just \Nby thinking in such a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.18,0:02:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'll take my time and think \Nit over more in detail later!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.47,0:02:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'll go out to play now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.57,0:02:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You're always too lax!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.47,0:02:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm going to say this bluntly, \Nbut it's because you're a blockhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.07,0:02:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}A dunce!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.58,0:02:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And on top of that, you're the type \Nwho finds everything bothersome...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You hate studying...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.72,0:02:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And always depend on \Nothers to do everything for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.63,0:02:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just suck it up, do what you've \Ngotta do, and it'll be done in a flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.88,0:02:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What do you mean \NI'm a natural blockhead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.34,0:02:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}I'm taking this touch stance and saying what \Nneeds to be said today for {\i1}your {\i0}sake, Nobita-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.46,0:02:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Doraemon...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Did you understand what \NI'm trying to say, Nobita-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:02:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}All right! Then \Ntoughen up and go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:03:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah, so hurry up and help me! \NYou'll make it be done in a flash!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.47,0:03:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Doraemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oww...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.46,0:03:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, I know! I'll use {\i1}that{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.28,0:03:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's see here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.65,0:03:10.07,Gadget,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HD0&\3c&HFFFFFF&\fs120\blur30\t(0,600,\1a&H00&\blur0\c&HDACFA5&\3c&H415055&)\pos(637,345)}{\frz15}F{\frz13}e{\frz11}e{\frz9}l{\frz7}i{\frz5}n{\frz3}g{\frz1} {\frz-1}C{\frz-3}o{\frz-5}l{\frz-7}o{\frz-9}g{\frz-11}n{\frz-13}e
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.61,0:03:12.28,Gadget,,0,0,0,,{\q2\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&HD0&\3c&HFFFFFF&\fs140\blur30\t(0,600,\1a&H00&\blur0\c&HDACFA5&\3c&H415055&)\pos(651,533)}Quick    Slow
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.17,0:03:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's the "Feeling Cologne: Quick" and the "Feeling Cologne: Slow"!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This one's Quick and this one's Slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.41,0:03:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}If you use the Quick Cologne, both \Nyour feelings and body will get faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.07,0:03:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And the Slow one does the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.85,0:03:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Now, come on... Put a spritz of this on, \Nand go get your homework done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.29,0:03:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, that sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'll do it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Augh! Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I hate cologne. \NDoes it {\i1}really {\i0} work?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.26,0:03:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Don't be rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.31,0:03:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Okay, then why don't you test it \Nout first and show me, Doraemon?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.07,0:03:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Sure, I can do that... \NBut it's okay with you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.28,0:03:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}If it's a really good \Ncologne, I'll use it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.88,0:03:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}All right, if you say so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.04,0:03:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}D-Doraemon...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.41,0:03:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Doraemon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.99,0:03:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.14,0:04:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Who are you calling "Nobi"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita-kun, you're so slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.31,0:04:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Do it! \NHurry, your homework!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.54,0:04:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Get it done!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.06,0:04:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You done yet?!\NYou done yet?! You done yet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.84,0:04:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh? Didn't I just sit down? \NI'm only just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.74,0:04:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You're so slow! \NDo it quicker! Quicker!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.65,0:04:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Gah! I'm really \Ngetting irritated!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.77,0:04:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So irritating...! Hurry, hurry...! \NGah! So irritating...! Hurry, hurry...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.97,0:04:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.14,0:04:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Are you done?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Uh, no. I'd just really like it \Nif you could calm down a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.44,0:04:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What're you talking about?!\NYou're not focusing enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.27,0:04:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Focus! Focus! Focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hup two! Hup two...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.41,0:04:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hup two! Hup two!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Where're you going?! \NNo, no, you can't skip out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.10,0:04:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2\be1}I'm going to ask Shizuka-chan to \Nexplain the parts I don't understand to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.00,0:04:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Fine! Hurry and get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.36,0:04:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Quickly! Get going! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.30,0:04:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.49,0:05:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Whew... \NThat stuff works {\i1}TOO {\i0}well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.98,0:05:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Life is meant to \Ntake things easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's it. Just relax \Nand take things easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.75,0:05:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.86,0:05:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was just going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.15,0:05:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What was that?!\NGah! You're so annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'll take you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey! You don't \Nneed to go so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.16,0:05:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What are \Nyou talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.10,0:05:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Stop being such a \Nslow poke and run! Run! Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.74,0:05:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}H-Hey! \NW-Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'll ring the doorbell in a jiffy, \Nthen charge in at the same time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.88,0:05:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.05,0:05:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Shizuka-chan, hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.49,0:05:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.57,0:05:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Say "Hi" while you're \Ntaking your shoes off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.07,0:05:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Is that for tea?! \NThank you, we'll enjoy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.96,0:05:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ah, but the water's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.85,0:05:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Here's tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.17,0:05:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Here, drink! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.36,0:05:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ew... What {\i1}IS {\i0} this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And I'll fart {\i1}before {\i0}\N I eat the roasted sweet potato!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.81,0:06:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And now we're done eating, so bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But I still have things \NI need to do there...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.83,0:06:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What?! What ?!\NWhat were you doing then?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.92,0:06:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Unbelievable! Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.71,0:06:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Unbelievable! What were you doing?!\NUnbelievable! Unbelievable! Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.11,0:06:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.13,0:06:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Okay, Doraemon! I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I got it, so can you \Nstop for a second?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm begging you. Please use the \NSlow Cologne and go back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.49,0:06:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}At this rate, I'll never be able to \Nconcentrate on my homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Okay, did you... Get the feeling... \Nto do your homework on your own?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.84,0:06:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Did you?! Did you?! Did you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.48,0:06:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I did, I did, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q0}{\be1}In that case, \NI'll go back to normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.49,0:06:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.19,0:06:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wait, isn't that "Quick"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.79,0:06:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.33,0:06:45.83,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Quick
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.98,0:06:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Get the Slow! Get the Slow! \NGet the Slow! Get the Slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.07,0:06:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ah, there it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.24,0:06:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.64,0:06:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is a problem! This is a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.86,0:06:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.15,0:06:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Come on! \NGimme it! Gimme it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.35,0:06:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah, I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.21,0:06:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's no use! Now that \NI've started running, I can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.47,0:07:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Someone stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.55,0:07:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.01,0:07:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hurry! \NCatch me! Catch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.21,0:07:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What're you doing? \NWhat're you doing? You dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.98,0:07:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.48,0:07:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I've gotta put \Non some Quick, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.81,0:07:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This one's Quick. This one's Slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.48,0:07:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}He sure is dumb to \Nget them mixed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.13,0:07:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, no! \NI mixed them up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I needed this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.23,0:07:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh... well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.05,0:07:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}If... I... leave... him... be...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:08:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's...cologne...so... \Nit'll...wear...off...eventually...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.30,0:08:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Right...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.14,0:08:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'll...go...home...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.76,0:08:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What was \Nthat wind just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.53,0:08:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}D-D-Did N-N-Nobita-kun \Ncome home yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It doesn't seem like \Nhe has, yet, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.07,0:08:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Man, I'm \Ngetting exhausted...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.07,0:08:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}My body's worn out, but \NI'm running on pure adrenaline!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.32,0:08:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}If I don't hurry and put some of that \NSlow Cologne on, I'm going to break!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.49,0:08:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.15,0:09:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Like...I...would...lose...to...you...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.34,0:09:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This escargot is \Nabsolutely superb.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.51,0:09:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.85,0:09:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No...matter...how...\Nyou...look...at...me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.41,0:09:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm...really...fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.38,0:09:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But...it...looks...\Nlike...I'm...gonna...lose...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'll...do...my...best...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.71,0:09:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}'Ey, Nobita.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.91,0:09:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.36,0:09:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm...racing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.00,0:09:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Against...a...snail...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.07,0:09:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.50,0:09:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I...lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.07,0:09:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You're...really...fast...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.61,0:10:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But ya' know, dey say \Nfrogs're pretty tasty, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.78,0:10:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}'N dere are bunches of \N'em in da school pond...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.48,0:10:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Gian, Suneo... \NGian... Suneo...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.42,0:10:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Tell me! Tell me! Tell me! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.12,0:10:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Tell me! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.15,0:10:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Tell you what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.85,0:10:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}About Nobita, of course! \NDon't you know? Don't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.79,0:10:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hurry, tell me! \NI said hurry, tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.77,0:10:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Quickly! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.48,0:10:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}If ya' wanna \Nknow 'bout Nobita...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.48,0:10:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Gah! You're {\i1}SO {\i0} \Nslow, I can't stand it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.29,0:10:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Enough! I'll just \Nlook for him myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.93,0:10:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wut da...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.94,0:10:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I...am...home...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.70,0:10:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What are you doing, \Nstanding out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.50,0:11:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}He said he was waiting for \Nsomeone to open the door for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.31,0:11:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I wonder if he tired \Nhimself out by playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.51,0:11:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobi-chan, you're \Ngoing to spill these.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.87,0:11:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What's that? Some \Nkind of perfume sample?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.21,0:11:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Mmm... It has a \Nreally nice fragrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.89,0:11:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.64,0:11:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.98,0:11:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That...is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.63,0:11:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I can't wait all day. \NHurry up and spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.68,0:11:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What does it smell like? \NLet me try some, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.38,0:11:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.09,0:11:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm...too...late...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.51,0:11:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It finally wore off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.09,0:11:48.89,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Aomori is 715 kilometers from Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.09,0:11:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I ran all the way to Aomori...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.91,0:11:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.23,0:11:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Don't tell me that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.02,0:11:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I work, then "good morning", \Nthen "I'm going home".
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.52,0:12:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'll do tomorrow's \Nshopping before dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.02,0:12:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Come here. This time, \Nput on some Slow, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.56,0:12:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Man! You guys are all so loud, \NI can't concentrate on my homework!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.17,0:12:12.46,Default,Typesetting,0,0,0,,{\bord0\1a&H00&\4a&HFF&\be1\fad(0,0)\c&H8BA6B6&\clip(m 308 215 l 286 356 1006 390 1003 239 768 220)\pos(632,373)}{\p1}m 0 0 l 970 0 970 225 0 225{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.17,0:12:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnAnna\fs155\bord4\3a&H00&\shad0\fscx102\c&HBA7200&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(650,375)}Mini {\c&HC08AE7&}Theater
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I never want to see \NGian's face ever again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.96,0:12:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Pull out some gadget that makes it so \Nyou'll never see a person you don't like!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.72,0:12:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2\be1}If you wave this with your right hand, \Nit'll make any other person get away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.22,0:12:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.09,0:12:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And to cancel it, you \Ndo it with your left hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.48,0:12:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1\q2}If you don't cancel it, you'll never \Nbe able to see them again for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.94,0:12:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}'Ey, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And with that, I can live \Nwithout ever seeing Gian again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.65,0:12:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You never do \Nyour homework!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.16,0:12:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And that gets rid of \None more scary person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Now I think I'll go \Nplay as long as I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.29,0:12:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Where did you drop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}If you don't cancel it with that handkerchief, \NMom will never come home, for all eternity!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.05,0:13:01.97,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs115\c&HEC9082&\pos(645,518)}Nobita's Wife
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.55,0:13:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}"Nobita's Wife!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.99,0:13:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.81,0:13:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Do you mind telling me \Nwhy you got this terrible score?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.47,0:13:13.23,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Dreams for your future
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.47,0:13:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}When you grow up, you're going to be entering \Nthe workforce and getting married, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.74,0:13:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What do you think your \Nchildren will be saying about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.98,0:13:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Do you want them to say "My dad \Nalways got nothing but zeroes"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.70,0:13:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobi! Are you listening to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.75,0:13:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, what are you gonna \Nbe when you grow up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.16,0:13:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm gonna be a nurse!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.12,0:13:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm going to be a wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.71,0:13:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh? Whose~?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, I don't know that, yet~!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}If I get married, I hope it's to a girl \Nlike that pop star, Marui Mari-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.33,0:13:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What's wrong, Gian?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.39,0:13:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Well, Ma wuz talkin' ta me...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.19,0:13:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2\be1}'N she said "If you get married, it needs to \Nbe a burly girl, strong enough to lift a dresser".
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.34,0:13:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Dun laff 'bout it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:13:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Whoa, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\be1}Before all that, you don't even know \Nwhether you {\i1}CAN {\i0} get married or not, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.23,0:14:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ah... Well, dat's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.83,0:14:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Are ya' sayin' dat I can't get married?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.31,0:14:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Den wut about {\i1}YOU{\i0} ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.91,0:14:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I-I can get married, \Njust like I'm supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.91,0:14:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita getting married?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.74,0:14:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2\be1}Dere ain't no way sumone who gets nuttin' \Nbut zeroes like ya' could ever get married!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Time sure flies by, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.92,0:14:25.93,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Kindergarten
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.39,0:14:30.35,Note,,0,0,0,,{\be1}School Entrance Ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.67,0:14:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It seems like it was just yesterday \Nthat he was starting kindergarten...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.39,0:14:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And before you know it, \Nhe's an elementary schooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.66,0:14:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And pretty soon, \Nhe'll be a middle schooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.74,0:14:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And then right after that, \Nhe'll start high school and college.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Well... If he can \Neven get accepted to one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.92,0:14:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ah! Are these Mom \Nand Dad's wedding pictures?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.61,0:14:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wow... These really take me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.46,0:14:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.74,0:14:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I wonder if the day when Nobita takes a bride will ever come...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.74,0:14:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:14:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.15,0:15:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.75,0:15:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.13,0:15:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I wonder what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.75,0:15:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What if...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.16,0:15:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just what if I can't \Nget married? What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.64,0:15:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Come on... Are you \Nseriously that worried about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.75,0:15:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.75,0:15:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Well, if you're that worried \Nabout it, why don't we go see?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Go see... what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.76,0:15:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Go see your future \Nwife in the Time Machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.76,0:15:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No way! Just thinking of \Nit is making me so embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.44,0:15:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Then I'll drop the subject.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.73,0:15:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No, I really, {\i1}really {\i0} wanna see!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.89,0:15:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Which one is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's go 25 years in the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.47,0:15:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2\be1}By that time, even someone as \Nuseless as you will have found {\i1}someone{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The "someone as useless \Nas you" part was uncalled for!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.39,0:15:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We popped out in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.44,0:16:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hmm... The place \Nmust have been rebuilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, so that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.75,0:16:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.12,0:16:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What is it this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.75,0:16:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There's nothing but bathrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.75,0:16:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}My house turned \Ninto a public restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.76,0:16:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.94,0:16:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hmm... It looks like this \Narea was turned into a park.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.73,0:16:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Then, where's my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.75,0:16:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Whoa, awesome! That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.93,0:16:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wow! All the cars \Nzipping by look so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's a police box! \NLet's try asking there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.90,0:16:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.27,0:16:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That area was turned into \Na park about ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.14,0:16:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let me see... You're \Nlooking for Nobi-san, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobi Nobita-kun, the scatterbrained \Nguy who can't do anything right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobi Nobita-san lives over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.45,0:16:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}He moved to that \Nhigh-rise apartment building.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.75,0:17:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}He's on the 12th floor, apartment 68.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.42,0:17:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Thank you for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The way the town looks \Nhas completely changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.75,0:17:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wow! If I can live in a place like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.76,0:17:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Maybe I've become rich?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.94,0:17:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That'd be nice, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.71,0:17:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.50,0:17:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}W-Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}O-On second thought, \Nmeeting them is a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.36,0:17:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Well, I guess that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.18,0:17:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I wanna just sneak a peek \Nat them from the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.28,0:17:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}All right. I'll let you \Nborrow the X-Ray Glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:17:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It lets you be able to \Nsee through any kind of wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.06,0:18:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And I can see them with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.81,0:18:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But even if this \N{\i1}is {\i0}my own house...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Peeking in is \Nreally bad, isn't it~?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.88,0:18:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, what should I do~?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.62,0:18:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Then give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.75,0:18:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No, I'll look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.78,0:18:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.82,0:18:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There she is! \NThere she is, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.98,0:18:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's my wife! \NShe was really there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.32,0:18:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's great. \NSo what kind of person is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.64,0:18:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I could only \Nsee her from behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.09,0:18:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.19,0:18:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No, yuck! \NShe's scary-looking!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.76,0:18:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You can tell me that, but \Nwhat am I supposed to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.02,0:18:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}They are certainly taking a long time! \NWhere could they have possibly gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.76,0:18:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.20,0:18:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Do something, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.75,0:19:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But you see, now you \Nknow you're able to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.77,0:19:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Right? Isn't that great?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.41,0:19:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.77,0:19:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No! It'd be better \Nto NOT get married!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.23,0:19:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I know! Let's look \Na little closer! Okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.54,0:19:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2\be1}Let's see... Where's a place \Nwhere we can get a closer look...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.32,0:19:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No matter where I look \Nfrom, she'll still be the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.89,0:19:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There. I caught you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Come with me, young man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}N-No, I don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.09,0:19:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.43,0:19:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.83,0:19:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wait! You've got \Nthe wrong person!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.62,0:19:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You're always, {\i1}always{\i0} \Nmaking my poor Sunetaro cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I apologize. Our Nobisuke is a very \Nnaughty boy, and he tends to act up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.75,0:20:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}"Our Nobisuke..."?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.77,0:20:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\be1}Go on! You need to \Napologize, too, young man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.49,0:20:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Please punish him very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.52,0:20:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I really, truly apologize \Nfor the trouble he caused you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.74,0:20:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Shizuka-san! This is because \Nyou don't keep him under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.58,0:20:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Shizuka-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Honestly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.60,0:20:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.97,0:20:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}C-Could it be...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.59,0:20:28.00,Boy Thought,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Is this Shizuka-chan, \N25 years in the future...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:31.10,Boy Thought,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}This "Nobisuke" has a \Nface that looks just like mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:33.21,Boy Thought,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}That would mean... he's my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.21,0:20:35.12,Boy Thought,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}And Shizuka-chan is his mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.12,0:20:36.21,Boy Thought,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}So that means...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.21,0:20:38.22,Boy Thought,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}That means... That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.22,0:20:39.47,Boy Thought,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}That means...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.99,0:20:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}By any chance, are you \NMinamoto Shizuka-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.78,0:20:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Why are you asking \Nsomething so obvious?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.08,0:20:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I see! So it was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.14,0:20:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So that's who it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.23,0:20:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, I'm {\i1}SO {\i0}happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.86,0:21:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What is with you, looking \Nat your mom like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.56,0:21:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm so happy...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.26,0:21:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Your father is such a quiet, \Ncarefree, obedient person...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.12,0:21:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So why are you \Nsuch an unruly child?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.95,0:21:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What are you doing? Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You've got \Nthe wrong person!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.30,0:21:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.63,0:21:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.13,0:21:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}W-What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.39,0:21:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You see?! \N{\i1}That's {\i0}Nobisuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.85,0:21:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There are two Nobisukes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.76,0:21:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Who are you?!\NAnd what are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.52,0:21:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobisuke! You mustn't be so violent!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.76,0:21:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}And are you studying, \Nlike you're supposed to?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.53,0:21:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Mom! This guy's an alien!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.31,0:21:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}He took my form, and \Ncame to take over our house!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.59,0:21:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey! Look at your father \Nwhen he's speaking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.42,0:21:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What do you mean, "father"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.41,0:21:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Father?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.23,0:21:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey! Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.78,0:22:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh... Nobita-kun sure \Nis taking a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.43,0:22:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.50,0:22:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Run, Doraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.76,0:22:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wait, Nobita-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.89,0:22:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.21,0:22:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Dora-chan...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.77,0:22:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Doraemon, let's hurry \Nback to the Time Machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.86,0:22:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}He's after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.78,0:22:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, no! \NSomeone's in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.62,0:22:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What're we gonna do, Doraemon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.17,0:22:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.79,0:22:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We're begging you! Please \Nhurry up in there and come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.98,0:22:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So {\i1}THIS {\i0} is where you were...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.78,0:22:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You alien fiends have \Nnowhere else to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.89,0:22:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, no! \NHe's gonna get us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.42,0:23:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What a violent boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.19,0:23:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Well, at least he's energetic, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.77,0:23:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But to think that I \Nmarry Shizuka-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.78,0:23:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But the future might change, so....
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.76,0:23:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I know. I'll work hard to \Nbecome a really great grown-up...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.91,0:23:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So then I'll marry Shizuka-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.79,0:23:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.88,0:23:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.60,0:23:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Shizuka-chan's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.17,0:23:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Sorry to impose on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.77,0:23:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hey, Nobita-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.39,0:23:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.79,0:23:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Why is he all shy and \Nembarrassed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.72,0:23:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Sure is a strange boy.